===New Zealand National Party (59)===
The [[New Zealand National Party|National Party]] won 47.31% of the vote, entitling it to 59 seats. As it won 42 electorates, an additional 17 members were taken from the party list.<ref name="prelim results" />

Nine new National Party members were elected, six from electorates and three from the party list. Fifty members from the 49th Parliament were returned.

